"欢迎使用 JoyCoding" = "Welcome to JoyCoding";
"JoyCoding 将逐步获得完整手柄读取和后续发送键盘按键所需的权限。系统授权只会在你点击按钮后请求。" = "JoyCoding needs permissions to read controller input and send keyboard events. The system requests permission only after you click a button.";
"输入监控" = "Input Monitoring";
"用于未来支持原始 HID 和部分特殊手柄按键；标准 GameController 手柄无需此权限也能显示。" = "Used for future raw HID and special controller buttons. Standard GameController input works without it.";
"辅助功能" = "Accessibility";
"用于后续把手柄操作转换为系统级键盘事件；当前按键测试不会发送键盘事件。" = "Used to turn controller actions into system keyboard events. Button testing does not send keyboard events.";
"允许输入监控" = "Allow Input Monitoring";
"输入监控将用于未来读取标准 GameController 未暴露的原始 HID 与特殊按键。你可以暂时跳过，标准手柄按键测试仍然可用。" = "Input Monitoring will be used to read raw HID and special buttons not exposed by GameController. You can skip it for now; standard controller testing still works.";
"请求输入监控权限" = "Request Input Monitoring";
"允许辅助功能" = "Allow Accessibility";
"辅助功能允许 JoyCoding 在后续映射阶段代表你发送键盘事件。此初始化版本不会发送任何键盘事件。" = "Accessibility lets JoyCoding send keyboard events for mappings. This initial version does not send keyboard events.";
"请求辅助功能权限" = "Request Accessibility";
"设置已完成" = "Setup Complete";
